{
  "id": "boundary-push-01",
  "reviewed_on": "2026-10-01",
  "description": "AttackDist / PlayerPush / ScreenBound / Width の押し合い・画面境界を公式3世代資料へ対応させる。Width の旧必須表記と ScreenBound の旧カメラ中心説明は公開だけ訂正し、旧用途・数値範囲・未確認の戻り動作は保存する。",
  "documents": [
    {
      "collection": "state-controllers", "name": "AttackDist", "additions": [
        { "path": ["page", "engine"], "value": "mugen" },
        { "path": ["page", "introduced_in"], "value": null },
        { "path": ["documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>実行者の現在の HitDef にある <code>guard.dist</code> を変更します。相手が後ろ方向を入力したときにガード状態へ移る距離です。現在有効な HitDef がなければ効果はありません。MUGEN 1.0 / 1.1 の公式資料は <code>MoveType = A</code> のときに効果があると記載します。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["attackdist-local-2002", "attackdist-local-1.0", "attackdist-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "required", "display": "新しいガード距離を指定", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["attackdist-local-2002", "attackdist-local-1.0", "attackdist-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>新しいガード距離をピクセル単位の整数式で指定します。省略できません。</p>", "hide_legacy": ["default_value"], "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["attackdist-local-2002", "attackdist-local-1.0", "attackdist-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
        { "path": ["evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["attackdist-local-2002", "attackdist-local-1.0", "attackdist-local-1.1"], "comment": "2026-10-01: HitDef guard.dist、必須 value、ピクセル距離を確認。2002資料はHitDefがないと効果なし、1.0/1.1資料はMoveType=A条件を記載。両条件の世代間同一性を実機確認したものではない。" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "attackdist-local-2002", "title": "AttackDist — 保存済み Elecbyte 2002.04.14 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/2002.04.14/sctrls.html#AttackDist", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "attackdist-local-1.0", "title": "AttackDist — 保存済み Elecbyte 1.0 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/1.0/sctrls.html#attackdist", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "attackdist-local-1.1", "title": "AttackDist — 保存済み Elecbyte 1.1 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/1.1b1/sctrls.html#attackdist", "source_type": "official_document" } }
      ], "remaining": [{ "path": "page.introduced_in", "reason": "初導入ビルドは不明を保持する。" }]
    },
    {
      "collection": "state-controllers", "name": "PlayerPush", "additions": [
        { "path": ["page", "engine"], "value": "mugen" },
        { "path": ["page", "introduced_in"], "value": null },
        { "path": ["documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>実行者とほかのプレイヤーが重なるのを防ぐ押し合い判定を、1 tick だけ切り替えます。判定を無効にすると相手をすり抜けられますが、攻撃を受ける判定とは別です。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["playerpush-local-2002", "playerpush-local-1.0", "playerpush-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "required", "display": "押し合い判定の有効・無効を指定", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["playerpush-local-2002", "playerpush-local-1.0", "playerpush-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>0なら押し合い判定を無効にし、0以外なら有効にする整数式です。省略できません。</p>", "hide_legacy": ["default_value"], "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["playerpush-local-2002", "playerpush-local-1.0", "playerpush-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
        { "path": ["notes"], "value": [{ "kind": "research", "content": "<p>旧 value 説明はプレイヤーの初期値1、ヘルパーの初期値0を記録する。今回確認した公式コントローラー資料は実行時の両者の初期状態を明記しないため、原文に保持して公開しない。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "unverified", "basis": ["official_document", "source_code"], "source_refs": ["playerpush-local-2002", "playerpush-local-1.0", "playerpush-local-1.1", "playerpush-legacy-data"] } }] },
        { "path": ["evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["playerpush-local-2002", "playerpush-local-1.0", "playerpush-local-1.1"], "comment": "2026-10-01: 押し合い判定、1 tick、有効値、すり抜け中も被弾可能を確認。プレイヤー/Helper初期値は未確認。" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "playerpush-local-2002", "title": "PlayerPush — 保存済み Elecbyte 2002.04.14 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/2002.04.14/sctrls.html#PlayerPush", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "playerpush-local-1.0", "title": "PlayerPush — 保存済み Elecbyte 1.0 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/1.0/sctrls.html#playerpush", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "playerpush-local-1.1", "title": "PlayerPush — 保存済み Elecbyte 1.1 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/1.1b1/sctrls.html#playerpush", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "playerpush-legacy-data", "title": "PlayerPush — 移行前の初期値説明原本", "url": "https://github.com/bluesura/bluesura.github.io/blob/0684461851fff0bcf6c31b6dea19076030effdb4/src/content/state-controllers/PlayerPush.json", "source_type": "source_code" } }
      ], "remaining": [{ "path": "page.introduced_in", "reason": "初導入ビルドは不明を保持する。" }, { "path": "parameter[0].description", "reason": "プレイヤー/Helper初期値は対象ビルドの実行記録がない。" }]
    },
    {
      "collection": "state-controllers", "name": "ScreenBound", "additions": [
        { "path": ["page", "engine"], "value": "mugen" },
        { "path": ["page", "introduced_in"], "value": null },
        { "path": ["documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>実行者が画面外へ移動できるかと、カメラが実行者を追うかを指定します。効果は1 tickです。<code>value</code> は画面境界、<code>MoveCamera</code> はカメラ追従を制御します。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["screenbound-local-2002", "screenbound-local-1.0", "screenbound-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "default"], "value": [
          { "kind": "unknown", "display": "Linux MUGEN 2002.04.14: 省略値は資料に明記なし", "environment": { "engine": "mugen", "runtime": ["mugen-linux"] }, "evidence": { "status": "unverified", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["screenbound-local-2002"] } },
          { "kind": "literal", "value": 0, "display": "MUGEN 1.0 / 1.1: 画面外への移動を許可", "environment": { "engine": "mugen", "runtime": ["mugen-1.0", "mugen-1.1"] }, "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["screenbound-local-1.0", "screenbound-local-1.1"] } }
        ] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "documentation"], "value": { "value": ["画面境界フラグ"], "description": "<p>0なら実行者は画面外へ移動できます。MUGEN 1.0 / 1.1 の公式資料では1なら画面内へ制限し、省略時は0です。Linux MUGEN 2002.04.14資料には省略値が明記されていません。</p>", "hide_legacy": ["default_value"], "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["screenbound-local-2002", "screenbound-local-1.0", "screenbound-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "literal", "value": "0, 0", "display": "X・Yとも追従しない", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["screenbound-local-2002", "screenbound-local-1.0", "screenbound-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "documentation"], "value": { "value": ["水平方向の追従フラグ", "垂直方向の追従フラグ"], "description": "<p>カメラが実行者を追うかを、X・Y方向の2つの整数フラグで指定します。MUGEN 1.0 / 1.1 の公式資料では1で追従し、省略時は両方とも0です。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["screenbound-local-2002", "screenbound-local-1.0", "screenbound-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
        { "path": ["notes"], "value": [{ "kind": "research", "content": "<p>旧 value 説明は value=0 がカメラ追従を止めるとし、解除時にスクロール開始位置へワープするとも記録する。公式資料は value を画面境界、MoveCamera を追従として区別し、旧ワープ条件は明記しないため、原文に保持して公開しない。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "conflicting", "basis": ["official_document", "source_code"], "source_refs": ["screenbound-local-2002", "screenbound-local-1.0", "screenbound-local-1.1", "screenbound-legacy-data"] } }] },
        { "path": ["evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["screenbound-local-2002", "screenbound-local-1.0", "screenbound-local-1.1"], "comment": "2026-10-01: 画面境界とカメラ追従の別パラメーター、1 tick、MoveCamera=0,0、1.0/1.1のvalue=0を確認。旧ワープ条件と2002のvalue省略値は未確認。" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "screenbound-local-2002", "title": "ScreenBound — 保存済み Elecbyte 2002.04.14 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/2002.04.14/sctrls.html#ScreenBound", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "screenbound-local-1.0", "title": "ScreenBound — 保存済み Elecbyte 1.0 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/1.0/sctrls.html#screenbound", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "screenbound-local-1.1", "title": "ScreenBound — 保存済み Elecbyte 1.1 公式資料", "url": "/MUGEN/document/Official/1.1b1/sctrls.html#screenbound", "source_type": "official_document" } },
        { "path": ["quote", "-"], "value": { "id": "screenbound-legacy-data", "title": "ScreenBound — 移行前の説明原本", "url": "https://github.com/bluesura/bluesura.github.io/blob/0684461851fff0bcf6c31b6dea19076030effdb4/src/content/state-controllers/ScreenBound.json", "source_type": "source_code" } }
      ], "remaining": [{ "path": "page.introduced_in", "reason": "初導入ビルドは不明を保持する。" }, { "path": "parameter[0].default", "reason": "2002資料では value 省略値が未記載。" }, { "path": "parameter[0].description", "reason": "旧ワープ条件は対象ビルドと再現ログがない。" }]
