    {
      "collection": "state-controllers", "name": "Width", "additions": [
        { "path": ["page", "engine"], "value": "mugen" },
        { "path": ["page", "introduced_in"], "value": null },
        { "path": ["documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p>実行者の画面端に対する幅と、ほかのプレイヤーとの押し合い幅を1 tickだけ変更します。<code>Edge</code> は画面端、<code>Player</code> はほかのプレイヤーとの距離を調整します。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "literal", "value": "0, 0", "display": "前方・後方とも0", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "documentation"], "value": { "parameter_type": "optional", "description": "<p>画面端に対する前方・後方の幅を整数式2つで指定します。省略時は <code>0, 0</code> です。</p>", "hide_legacy": ["min_value", "max_value"], "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 0, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "literal", "value": "0, 0", "display": "前方・後方とも0", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "documentation"], "value": { "parameter_type": "optional", "description": "<p>ほかのプレイヤーとの押し合いに使う前方・後方の幅を整数式2つで指定します。省略時は <code>0, 0</code> です。</p>", "hide_legacy": ["min_value", "max_value"], "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 1, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 2, "expression_policy"], "value": "expression" },
        { "path": ["parameter", 2, "default"], "value": [{ "kind": "none", "display": "Edge / Player の代替書式であり、単独の既定値はない", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 2, "documentation"], "value": { "description": "<p><code>Edge</code> と <code>Player</code> の前方・後方の幅を同じ値へ一度に設定する代替書式です。<code>Edge</code> または <code>Player</code> と同時には指定できません。</p>", "hide_legacy": ["default_value", "min_value", "max_value"], "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1"] } } },
        { "path": ["parameter", 2, "constraints"], "value": [{ "kind": "alias", "parameters": ["Edge", "Player"], "description": "value は Edge と Player の両方を一度に設定する代替構文。両パラメーターと併用できない。", "evidence": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1"] } }] },
        { "path": ["parameter", 2, "load_priority_evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["maintainer_report"], "comment": "既存の読み込み順は基本的に検証済みとの管理者確認（2026-09-07）。検証ビルド等の詳細は未記録。" } },
        { "path": ["notes"], "value": [{ "kind": "research", "content": "<p>旧 Width 概要は投げ技中の攻撃側での使用、ScreenBound 代替、<code>Edge=40</code> による進入不能域を説明する。公式資料は基本的な幅と押し合いを記載するが、この制作用途と例の対象ビルドは不明なため原文に保持し公開しない。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "unverified", "basis": ["official_document", "source_code"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1", "width-legacy-data"] } }, { "kind": "research", "content": "<p>旧 Edge / Player / value の各値域は -2147483647〜2147483647 とする。公式3資料に範囲の明記がないため、旧値を残して公開しない。</p>", "evidence": { "status": "unverified", "basis": ["official_document", "source_code"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1", "width-legacy-data"] } }] },
        { "path": ["evidence"], "value": { "status": "confirmed", "basis": ["official_document"], "source_refs": ["width-local-2002", "width-local-1.0", "width-local-1.1"], "comment": "2026-10-01: 1 tick、Edge/Player任意、省略時各0,0、value代替構文と併用禁止、デバッグ表示色を確認。旧 required 表記と32-bit値域は確認済みとしない。" } },
